```

## 📊 Grade Calculation

| Average Marks | Grade |
|---|---|
| 90 - 100 | A+ |
| 80 - 89 | A |
| 70 - 79 | B |
| 60 - 69 | C |
| 50 - 59 | D |
| Below 50 | Fail |

**Note:** If a student scores below 35 in any subject, the result will be Fail.

